{
 "meta": {
  "lane": "a",
  "task": "t119",
  "chunk": "a/030",
  "family": "NOR10"
 },
 "entries": [
  {
   "key": "u07779",
   "en": "We could get drummed out of the service for fraternization. Of course, we'll probably get the firing squad for mutiny.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07780",
   "en": "Kaidan, there's a difference between me ranting in private and us--I don't know--launching a coup or something.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07781",
   "en": "Absolutely we should. But the Council can be salvaged. We shouldn't need to replace them. They just need to listen when we talk realpolitik.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07782",
   "en": "I don't know. They haven't shown any interest in listening to us so far.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07783",
   "en": "You haven't had the easiest life. But I like the man it's made of you.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07784",
   "en": "It's nothing personal, Kaidan. It's just-- I could cheerfully toss every Council member out of the airlock right now.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07785",
   "en": "I think you need more practice appreciating me. On the floor and give me 20, Lieutenant!",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07786",
   "en": "We lost the battle, not the war. I'll figure something out.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07787",
   "en": "You probably shouldn't call me that. I probably shouldn't even be wearing this uniform.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07788",
   "en": "Blind, useless fools. I'd have given them fiddles, but I doubt they read history.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07789",
   "en": "I keep reminding myself we're doing the right thing. I don't believe me yet.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07790",
   "en": "Kaidan, I don't think I've had the pleasure of you serving under me. Don't you think it's time to rectify that?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07791",
   "en": "I can make you feel much more than that. Come here.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07792",
   "en": "Kaidan, you make me feel I could take on the universe. And right now? I kind of have to.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07793",
   "en": "I said push them aside.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07794",
   "en": "You took it too seriously.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07795",
   "en": "Hey, it's all right.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07796",
   "en": "We can hope.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07797",
   "en": "Back at you.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07798",
   "en": "When the job is done.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07799",
   "en": "It's not you.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07800",
   "en": "Not a goddamned chance.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07801",
   "en": "I'm asking you, not the crew.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07802",
   "en": "I don't care what they think.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07803",
   "en": "Don't overdo it, Romeo.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07804",
   "en": "Appreciate me more.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07805",
   "en": "You're too cautious.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07806",
   "en": "This isn't over.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07807",
   "en": "Not sure I deserve the rank.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07808",
   "en": "Oh, be a man!",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07809",
   "en": "It doesn't have to stop there.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07810",
   "en": "No games.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07811",
   "en": "Yeah. It always does.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07812",
   "en": "That's a generous attitude. Okay. I think there's something wrong with all this.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07813",
   "en": "It's rough sometimes, but they spike higher than a lot of L3s. Except for you, of course.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07814",
   "en": "The L2's spike higher, anyway. My abilities would drop with pain-free L3's.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07815",
   "en": "I just hope she doesn't compromise our mission.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07816",
   "en": "I hope so, Commander.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07817",
   "en": "I'll do my duty, ma'am. Your private life is none of my business.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07818",
   "en": "I'm-- disappointed. Sure. But you made your choice. I'll do my duty. Don't worry about that.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07819",
   "en": "Just forget it, okay? Like Pascal said: \"The heart has its reasons, which reason cannot know.\"",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07820",
   "en": "No worries, ma'am. I was never much for writing poetry. Limericks, sometimes.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07821",
   "en": "She seems like a nice girl, ma'am. I hope things work out between you two.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07822",
   "en": "Assuming more crap doesn't come up.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07823",
   "en": "Alenko, when it's just you and me, you can consider it off the record.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07824",
   "en": "They deserve to know what we're up against.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07825",
   "en": "Those communications are classified, Lieutenant.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07826",
   "en": "And what do they think?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07827",
   "en": "Anything I can do?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07828",
   "en": "You distrust them that much?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07829",
   "en": "There's politics and then there's people. Alien or not, I'm fond of her.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07830",
   "en": "She's not anti-human. In time, she'll come around to our way of thinking.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07831",
   "en": "Unlike most of them, she's willing to listen to us.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07832",
   "en": "You're a good man, Kaidan. I'm sorry it didn't work out.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07833",
   "en": "Good. High school angst would really annoy me.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07834",
   "en": "I didn't think you'd do otherwise.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07835",
   "en": "Like we'll have time off.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07836",
   "en": "Speak your mind.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07837",
   "en": "They shouldn't.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07838",
   "en": "You all right?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07839",
   "en": "Angry?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07840",
   "en": "Love thy enemy.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07841",
   "en": "She'll listen to me.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07842",
   "en": "Liara understands.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07843",
   "en": "Glad to hear it.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07844",
   "en": "I wasn't.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07845",
   "en": "I keep thinking about the dead. I don't see how we could have done better. I just wish we could have.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07846",
   "en": "No offense. I'm sure you saw worse on Akuze.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07847",
   "en": "Well. I'm sure you saw worse at Torfan.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07848",
   "en": "But you can only save so many, right? You must know that better than me. From Elysium.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07849",
   "en": "It's probably best they abandoned the colony. Who knows what else might be hiding in those ruins?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07850",
   "en": "Besides, that place is all grey and yellow. Depressing place to raise kids.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07851",
   "en": "One of my cousins has an agri business. I was thinking of calling him. Maybe he can get some shipments into Feros.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07852",
   "en": "I mean, now that they're cut off from the company.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07853",
   "en": "Hell of a deal you worked out with Jeong, though. ",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07854",
   "en": "If I ever get a speeding ticket, I want you to be my advocate.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07855",
   "en": "I'm sure Dr. T'Soni's hurting, though. Poor kid. Having to kill her own mom.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07856",
   "en": "I'm sure Dr. T'Soni's hurting, though. Poor kid.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07857",
   "en": "I guess we'll be the ones to tell Dr. T'Soni. That's a hell of a thing to drop on her.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07858",
   "en": "Off the record?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07859",
   "en": "It's probably best you made the call.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07860",
   "en": "If we'd left it to the Council, it'd be tied up in committee for years.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07861",
   "en": "If we'd had the option, I'd as soon have left it to the Council.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07862",
   "en": "We weren't out here during the rachni war. I'm not sure we have any business getting involved.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07863",
   "en": "She seems nice enough.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07864",
   "en": "Hard to believe she's older than both of us put together.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07865",
   "en": "Seems like a sweet girl. Easy on the eyes.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07866",
   "en": "I mean, if you like the bookish sort.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07867",
   "en": "None, Commander. I prefer adventurous women.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07868",
   "en": "No, Commander. Just art appreciation.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07869",
   "en": "They do say asari are open to that sort of thing. Ma'am.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07870",
   "en": "Only by a few seconds, sir.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07871",
   "en": "Any opinion on the rachni?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07872",
   "en": "Any intentions there, Lieutenant?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07873",
   "en": "Just remember, Lieutenant. I saw her first.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07875",
   "en": "Oh, I do.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07876",
   "en": "We're fighting giant machines from outside the galaxy. Should I be afraid of them? Or in awe of them? Anything so old, so intelligent...",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07877",
   "en": "I hear you, Shepard.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07878",
   "en": "Yeah, they've been around a while. So were the turians. We gave them a boot in the ass.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07879",
   "en": "We don't need to appreciate their culture, Alenko. We need to blow them up. Period.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07880",
   "en": "We may be ants to them, but humans have never managed to exterminate ants.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07881",
   "en": "They're old all right.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07882",
   "en": "Just do the job.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07883",
   "en": "We'll beat them.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07884",
   "en": "Dealing, sir.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07885",
   "en": "I understand. It's just--",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07886",
   "en": "I've served for years, but never lost a soldier under my command. Not to hostile action, anyway.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07887",
   "en": "If you don't mind my asking, how did you deal with the losses on Torfan?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07888",
   "en": "If you don't mind my asking, how did you deal with the losses on Akuze?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07889",
   "en": "If you don't mind my asking, how did you deal with the losses on Elysium?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07890",
   "en": "Yeah, I guess that's all we can do.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07891",
   "en": "I'm in for the duration, Commander. No worries about that.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07892",
   "en": "You're right. I can't let this get to me. Not now, anyway.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07893",
   "en": "Thanks for the advice, sir.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07894",
   "en": "I think we're gonna need a bigger boot, Commander.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07895",
   "en": "It makes you wonder. Are ants any more aware than we were? Of the giants that walk over their heads?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07896",
   "en": "I wanted to see how you're dealing with Ash's death.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07897",
   "en": "I understand. I don't like losing people either.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07898",
   "en": "Every one of us is expendable if it accomplishes the mission. Ash. You. Me.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07899",
   "en": "I don't like losing people either, Alenko.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07900",
   "en": "It was my job to get everyone out safe. I failed. I vowed not to let that happen again. Same here. I'll remember her, and I'll do better for her.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07901",
   "en": "We accept death when we put on the uniform, Lieutenant. If you can't deal with that, retire.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07902",
   "en": "I didn't stop and agonize over it while everyone else was in danger. We've got work to do, Alenko. We'll remember her later.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07903",
   "en": "About Williams.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07904",
   "en": "We're soldiers.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07905",
   "en": "I vowed to do better.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07906",
   "en": "They did their duty.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07907",
   "en": "I grieved. Later.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07908",
   "en": "We haven't had time together since our last chat and... a lot was said. When we talked.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07909",
   "en": "So why are you telling me this? Is there something I can do to help you get over it?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07910",
   "en": "You like her?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07911",
   "en": "Why tell me?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07912",
   "en": "But you know the Navy Grapevine.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07913",
   "en": "Dealing, ma'am.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07914",
   "en": "Sorry for anything I said back there. Adrenaline.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07915",
   "en": "Thanks for the advice, ma'am.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07916",
   "en": "There was never any proof of that. It's not what happened in my case, anyway.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07917",
   "en": "If you say so, ma'am.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07918",
   "en": "I heard all about that. How companies would arrange \"accidents\" to expose people to element zero.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07919",
   "en": "Damn corporations.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07920",
   "en": "And we were on the scene faster than any other Alliance ship could have been.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07921",
   "en": "I should remember that after what happened with Vyrnnus.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07922",
   "en": "But do we understand theirs any better?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
